### Prerequisites

- **E2SAR Library**: EJFAT protocol implementation ([E2SAR on GitHub](https://github.com/JeffersonLab/E2SAR))
- **System Libraries**: pthread, rt (POSIX shared memory/semaphores)
- **C++17 compatible compiler** (g++ or clang++)
- **E2SAR Dependencies**: Boost (≥1.70), gRPC (≥1.40), Protocol Buffers

### Use Cases

- **GNU Radio Integration**: Stream GNU Radio flowgraph output to distributed workers
- **Real-time Event Processing**: Low-latency event distribution for physics experiments
- **Data Acquisition Systems**: Bridge DAQ events to network processing nodes
- **High-Performance Computing**: Zero-copy inter-process event streaming

